   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "早餐用彩色餐具盛放。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "80358222",
    "80331968"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/4b/c5/4bc5421793772dfc802c6371810fbf87.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/4b/c5/4bc5421793772dfc802c6371810fbf87.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>布置一张简单的餐桌&nbsp;</strong>这不需要大量复杂的安排。一些简单的彩色杯子和餐具就能让餐桌充满生机。小细节也能带来不同的氛围，比如换掉包装盒，用玻璃水瓶盛放果汁。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "动图：灯泡悬挂在餐桌上方。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/4e/69/4e69df29c3351dedebf05093204fc1b8.gif"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/4e/69/4e69df29c3351dedebf05093204fc1b8.gif",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>把灯具悬挂得低一点&nbsp;</strong>让冬日清晨阴冷的室内气氛变得温暖舒适。把餐桌上方的灯具挂得低一点，能让一同进餐的人们感到更加亲近。无需使用餐桌时，可以随时在天花板上添加一个挂钩，将灯具的位置拉高。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-quote",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "Sophie，伦敦",
    "在工作日的早晨，我们需要尽快进入工作状态。而在周末，我们有更多聚会闲聊的时间。"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "Sophie和Olly的照片。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/cc/01/cc01726e0490ec0530c01a5708355e1e.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
